{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-5-15","kind":"proposition","title":"等量关系：比例","englishTitle":"Parts have the same ratio as the same multiples of them taken in corresponding order.","book":5,"number":15,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.15","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.15/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":15,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-5-15@raw-6f4228849780dc26","contentId":"euclid-5-15","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6f4228849780dc2633876a23d215a38286340487760cce9f8000c76d24efd6b9","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-5-15.statement","euclid-5-15.construction.1","euclid-5-15.proof.1","euclid-5-15.construction.2","euclid-5-15.proof.2","euclid-5-15.proof.3","euclid-5-15.proof.4","euclid-5-15.conclusion","euclid-5-15.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-5-15.statement","contentId":"euclid-5-15","revisionId":"euclid-5-15@raw-6f4228849780dc26","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ca00906445693b91bbe2a50d23ebecf74ea135610b871875ec505f52472cc4cf","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Parts have the same ratio as the same multiples of them taken in corresponding order."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"部件的比例与按相应顺序排列的相同倍数的比例相同。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-15.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-5-15","revisionId":"euclid-5-15@raw-6f4228849780dc26","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"548073e2dbc431b1b936af47b7be2546e7dd6c77f61276d5ffbe9ea0e5ca4d8c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let AB be the same multiple of C that DE is of F; I say that, as C is to F, so is AB to DE."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AB是C的乘数,DE是F;我说,C对F的比等于AB对DE的比；C 与 F 之比等于 AB 与 DE 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-15.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-5-15","revisionId":"euclid-5-15@raw-6f4228849780dc26","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b2db5afadd906b36c1e74b59df2dfef0cb43d36dcd9f86ee6597451fd56b5cff","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, since AB is the same multiple of C that DE is of F, as many magnitudes as there are in AB equal to C, so many are there also in DE equal to F."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为AB是C的乘数,DE是F,AB的乘数与AB等于C的乘数相同,DE等于F的乘数也相同。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-15.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-5-15","revisionId":"euclid-5-15@raw-6f4228849780dc26","order":3,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6ae15eb452a5dccb6c3026f5dc8e7a59500eb4c2f1046361deb9a598712ae915","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let AB be divided into the magnitudes AG, GH, HB equal to C, and DE into the magnitudes DK, KL, LE equal to F; then the multitude of the magnitudes AG, GH, HB will be equal to the multitude of the magnitudes DK, KL, LE."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"将AB分为AG、GH、HB,相当于C,DE分为DK、KL、LE分为F;然后,AG、GH、HB等的数将等于DK、KL、LE等的数。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-15.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-5-15","revisionId":"euclid-5-15@raw-6f4228849780dc26","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ab64255ca6574188dee6bec2a1f157e24b450a91180c0551fccfba055b8ea07a","citations":["euclid-5-7"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since AG. GH, HB are equal to one another, and DK, KL, LE are also equal to one another, therefore, as AG is to DK, so is GH to KL, and HB to LE. [[V. 7](/principles/euclid-5-7)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AG.GH,HB相互平等,DK,KL,LE也相互平等,因此,AG对DK的比例等于GH对KL,HB对LE的比例；AG 与 DK 之比等于 GH 与 KL 之比。 [[V. 7](/principles/euclid-5-7)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-15.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-5-15","revisionId":"euclid-5-15@raw-6f4228849780dc26","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"abbfd831965728f21d73e2557775d145c4a2b5b72355652028dd5bb731df6a39","citations":["euclid-5-12"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore, as one of the antecedents is to one of the consequents, so will all the antecedents be to all the consequents; [[V. 12](/principles/euclid-5-12)] therefore, as AG is to DK, so is AB to DE."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,由于先于后应,因此,先于后应,所有后应,均先于后应;因此,AG比DK之比等于AB比DE之比；AG 与 DK 之比等于 AB 与 DE 之比。 [[V. 12](/principles/euclid-5-12)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-15.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-5-15","revisionId":"euclid-5-15@raw-6f4228849780dc26","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7e3395ae5ebe7bb7536c7d573cf63dac34576fa5b0445f62250e403162ccc87f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But AG is equal to C and DK to F; therefore, as C is to F, so is AB to DE."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但AG等于C,DK至F;因此,C至F的比等于AB至DE的比；C 与 F 之比等于 AB 与 DE 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-15.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-5-15","revisionId":"euclid-5-15@raw-6f4228849780dc26","order":7,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d41f4fe56dd428c759377c807a93013dffbbe29c7596acfdac57dd182cad51b6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,等等,证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-15.source","contentId":"euclid-5-15","revisionId":"euclid-5-15@raw-6f4228849780dc26","order":8,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"51bf3c1b8b8caa017580f27ee15dfa94ff61db1987c158ca0c1bb29bd42458af","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.15/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.15\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-5-15:euclid-5-7:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-5-15","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-5-15.proof.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-5-7","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.15","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.15/","sourceLabel":"V. 7"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-5-15:euclid-5-12:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-5-15","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-5-15.proof.3"],"targetContentId":"euclid-5-12","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_te